window.products.push({"id":256066,"name":"Mrs. Anderson’s Baking Chocolate Ice Chipper, 9-Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31FBR8NYEVL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Mrs. Anderson’s Chocolate Chipper easily breaks up block chocolate into smaller chunks for faster melting when baking and making sweet confections. The 6 sturdy prongs quickly break up blocks of baking chocolate into right-sized pieces for faster processing. Its contoured wooden handle is easy on the hands for added comfort during use. It’s also great for chipping larger chunks from block ice to chill all types of drinks and cocktails. Generously sized ice chunks melt slower than ice chips or ice cubes to prevent drinks from getting watered down as quickly. Easy to use. Simply tap the points of the Chocolate Chipper firmly against the block chocolate or ice block. Continue to obtain the desired sized pieces. A unique addition to baking tools and barware, Mrs. Anderson’s Chocolate Ice Chipper with wooden handle is easy to use and grip during use. Measures 9-inches long. Wipe with a damp cloth. Brought to you by HIC Harold Import Co. Amazon.com Martha Stewart cheerfully chops chocolate on her cooking show with an instrument like this, and now we can as well. This sturdy tool converts hard, thick baking-chocolate bars into chunks for cookies, sparing good kitchen knives when a recipe calls for you to break up chocolate before melting. It's even good for chipping ice for drinks or buffet displays. Overall, the tool measures 9 inches long, with a 5-inch hardwood handle and six pointed prongs that deliver satisfying blows. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31FBR8NYEVL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mrs. Anderson's Baking","source_asin":"B00005NUVX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-256066","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005NUVX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005NUVX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
