window.products.push({"id":256114,"name":"INSE Wet Dry Vacuum Cleaner Lightweight Cordless Vacuum and Mop for Hard Floors Wet-Dry Cleaning with LED Display and Voice Assistance-W5 (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":419.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QcitJEhGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【3-in-1 Wet Dry Vacuum】: The self-propelled multi-function wet dry vacuum cleaner could vacuum, mop and wash at the same time, leaving floors clean and dry, especialy ideal for pet hair, sticky wet messes, dry messes, messy spills, or tough stains etc daily cleaning chores, saving time and energy than normal vacuums. 【Hard Floor Cleaning】: Equipped with a soft microfiber roller brush, Cordless wet dry vacuum is ideal for hard floor, such as hardwood floor/tile floor/marble floor/vinyl/laminate/linoleum/sealed wood floors/rubber scraper floor mat and so on/Providing effectivily deep cleaning leaving no scratches/Besides, 1 spare roller cover for replace; 100 Pcs floor cleaning sheets for eliminate stubborn stain/dirt/odor/food/grease and grime; 2-in-1 Cleaning Gadget designed for multiple scenarios. 【One-touch Self-Cleaning&Drying】: The Wet/dry vacuum mop with 2-in-1 self-cleaning system, 3mins water cleaning automatically flushes the inner tubing and brush roller and 5mins self-drying. Compare with other common self-cleaning of wet-dry vacuum, inse W5 is designed to dry by the motor heating, which contributes to a clean and more dry brush bar, and won't cause any odour or mold. Automatically clean the roller brush with the press of a button to keep your hands dirt-free. 【VoicePrompt & LED Display】: Vacuum mop with LED display, built in helpful voice assistant ensuring a more convenient and user-friendly floor cleaning experience. Intuitive indicators for battery, suction power, self-cleaning, obstructions, and more let you know cleaning status at a glance by smart LED display. Voice prompts let you know use status of the upright vacuum cleanrs in real time and notify you when to empty the dirty water tank, add water, recharge as it needs and self-cleaning. 【Dual Tank Design & Lasting-Runtime】Hardwood floor vacuum and mop with a two-tank system mean you are always cleaning with fresh water, while dirty water and debris are collected in a separate tank, Clean water tank capacity is 450ml, dirty water tank capacity is 750ml. Self-propelled vacuum cleaners have standard mode and max mode to adapt vary cleaning requirements. Up to 35mins runtime and cordless design meet the whole-house dry and wet cleaning! 【Easy Storage & No-worry Service】INSE cordless vacuum cleaner and mop comes with a storage base so you can use it for recharge or store while not in use. Attached are 100 Pcs INSE dissolvable detergent sheets to help with floor and roller cleaning. Please note that non-INSE detergent sheets will cause corrosion and damage to the machine. It comes with 24x7 online customer service and a 12-month 100% satisfactory after-sales service for INSE vacuum. Any concerns, we are always here.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QcitJEhGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INSE","source_asin":"B09X9YS37C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-256114","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X9YS37C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X9YS37C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
