window.products.push({"id":256181,"name":"Butterfly Craze Floor Pillow Bed Lounger, Cozy and Stylish Seating Solution for Kids & Adults, Recliner Floor Cushion for Ultimate Comfort, 5 Pillows ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-Ktm7iw4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LOUNGE IN COMFORT & STYLE: With its easy-to-use design, you can simply stuff this Pillow Bed Floor Lounger with the 5 queen-sized, giant/large pillows that come with this set to create your ideal level of support while sitting or laying down. If you're looking for a comfy place to take a nap, a cozy spot for sleepovers, or just a place to relax & watch TV, this lounger has got you covered. Its versatile design makes it ideal for slumber parties, reading, playing games, or just lounging around. DESIGNED FOR ALL AGES: This pillow bed floor lounger is a piece of furniture that can be enjoyed by all ages. Whether you're a kid, teen, or adult, this offers convenience & style, making it the perfect choice for any home. This can even be used as a spare bed for tweens or teens, providing a convenient sleeping solution for guests or sleepovers. The cover is easy to stuff with big pillows, creating a cozy lounging seat or recliner that can be adjusted to your desired level of easement. DURABILITY & QUALITY: Made with plush, ultra-soft fabric, this pillow bed floor lounger offers the ultimate relaxation. The use of high-quality materials ensures that the lounger cover will last for years, providing you with a comfortable & stylish piece that you can enjoy for years to come. The cover is also equipped with sturdy zippers, making it easy to stuff with pillows. The combination of comfort, quality materials, & durable construction makes this lounger cover a great investment. EASY TO CLEAN: The cover is machine washable, making cleaning a breeze. Simply toss it in the machine on a delicate cycle with cold water and hang it to dry. No bleach is needed, making it a safe and convenient choice for families. The easy-to-clean design of the Butterfly Craze floor lounger cover ensures that it will always look and feel fresh and clean, no matter how much it's used. Enjoy its ease of maintenance for years to come. This really is the perfect choice for any home. SIZE & DIMENSIONS: The lounger cover measures 26” wide x 88” long. With its 5 zippers and 5 pockets, it can easily hold 5 standard-sized pillows, providing ample support and convenience. The queen-sized design makes it an ideal choice for individuals or families who are looking for a spacious and comfortable lounging option. Please note that 5 pillows are included in this set which saves you time and effort in trying to find matching pillows elsewhere.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-Ktm7iw4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Butterfly Craze","source_asin":"B09X26QJNF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-256181","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X26QJNF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X26QJNF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
