window.products.push({"id":256349,"name":"Juseepo Waterproof Digital Meat Thermometer, 2s Fast Instant Read BBQ Thermometer with Backlight Display and Foldable Probe, Suitable for Kitchen, Out","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712ld6FFMXS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Ultra fast and highly accurate] Our meat thermometer equips with a 4.3\" food-grade stainless steel probe with a precision sensor, which is easy to punch into the meat. Stay it in food for about 2s, and you will get an accurate temperature (±1°C). Whether it is fried steak, BBQ pork, fried fish or potatoes, or outdoor barbecue, this cooking thermometer can provide you with an accurate reference temperature. [Lock and calibration] This digital meat thermometer has a lock function, which can lock the temperature on the display, so you don't need to near to the heating for too long. The calibration function can restore your grill thermometer sensor to the correct accuracy, making it a long life kitchen thermometer! [Easy to use and store] The kitchen meat thermometer is easy to use, press the on/off button to turn on, press 3s to turn off. The 180-degree folding design probe and internal magnet are convenient for storage. The magnetic back cover allows the thermometer to be attached to the surface of household appliances, such as ovens, refrigerators, and other metal surfaces. [Perfect design, confident cooking] Our digital meat thermometer is designed with a bottle opener on the handle, and the package even includes a comprehensive cooking meat temperature guide, so you no longer worry about over-cooking or under-cooking, or damaging your steak. Cooking with confidence to achieve perfection and eat healthier. [Excellent quality] Our digital meat thermometer products have undergone precise and rigorous testing before leaving the factory. Its excellent construction quality is unparalleled in the market because we believe you deserve the best product.Whatever how long you have this product, if you have any issues or help about our product ,we will try our best to make things right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712ld6FFMXS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Juseepo","source_asin":"B08LG2FW9D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-256349","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LG2FW9D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LG2FW9D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
