window.products.push({"id":256379,"name":"BINO 2-Piece Stainless Steel Paring Knife & Utility Knife with Blade Guards Set - Speckled Black | Sharp Knife Set with Good Grip | Cooking Knives | P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qkn+rC+fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Paring Utility Knife: Our paring kitchen utility knife is an essential tool in any kitchen that can handle most everyday kitchen tasks. It is perfect for peeling, trimming, and slicing fruits and vegetables. The compact size and versatility of a paring knife make it a go-to tool for a wide range of kitchen tasks. Smooth Blade Edge: The smooth blade edge of a utility kitchen knife is designed to make precise cuts with minimal effort. The sharp, straight blade allows for controlled slicing and dicing of delicate ingredients like herbs, garlic, and shallots. Blade large size measures 5 inch serrated utility and small size measures is 3.75 inch. Long-Lasting Sharpness: Made from high-quality stainless steel, a a reliable tool that can withstand the demands of regular use. The durable material resists rust, ensuring that your knife will maintain its sharp edge for years to come. Stainless steel is also easy to clean and maintain, making it a practical choice for busy kitchens. Stylish Handle: The handle of a paring utility knife is just as important as the blade itself. A well-designed handle should be comfortable to hold and provide a secure grip for safe, precise cutting. Handle designs available are White Marble, Speckled Black, and Speckled White, a stylish handle can complement any kitchen decor, adding a touch of elegance to your cooking space. Kitchen Must Have: A paring utility knife is an absolute must-have for any kitchen. Its compact size, versatility, and precision make it an indispensable tool for a wide range of tasks. Whether you're a professional chef or a home cook, a paring utility knife is an essential tool for preparing everything from salads and soups to casseroles and roasts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qkn+rC+fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BINO","source_asin":"B0BRBNWXPF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-256379","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRBNWXPF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRBNWXPF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
