window.products.push({"id":256382,"name":"AHNR Bathroom Hanging Shower Caddy Over Shower Head Organizer, Rustproof Shower Organizer with Hooks and Adhesives, Anti-Swing Over the Shower Head Ca","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61guEr1L21L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌿【THREE LAYERS OF LARGE CAPACITY】: Compared to traditional over the shower head caddy, this never rust hanging shower caddy over shower head of ours has three baskets with 16 fixed hooks for maximum storage of your various sizes of shower gels, shampoos, conditioners, scrubs, face washes, razors, and other items. This over the shower head caddy is especially handy for couples, roommates and families because it better separates different people's toiletries. 🌿【PREVENT SWINGING】: The top hook adds non-slip rubber, which not only increases the force area, making the load-bearing capacity stronger, but also increases the friction, making the hanger less likely to slip. Both baskets have added non-marking adhesive to help fix, which helps you take items without wobbling. Note: Non-marking adhesive is best applied to a clean, smooth, non-porous surface. This will ensure that you have a better bathing experience. 🌿【ANTI-RUST & KEEP DRYING】: This hanging shower caddy is made of iron sheet + powder coating. The special process is not only strong, durable and beautiful, but also prevents rusting. The whole shower organizer hanging is hollowed out design, the hollow and open bottom is not easy to retain moisture, also can accelerate the drying, which also reduces the risk of rust. 🌿【EASY TO INSTALL】: Don't worry about drill holes in the wall! All you need to do to install this over the shower head caddy is to use a screwdriver to assemble the various parts. We also provide two super sticky non-marking adhesives, you just need to stick it in a smooth position. It is worth noting that: the large size of the shower needs to unscrew the showerhead before installation. 🌿【PRODUCT SIZE & NOTE】: The whole product size: 10.24inch * 4.33inch * 25.79inch; Big basket size 10.24inch * 4.33inch * 2.56inch; Middle height: 9.84inch; The height of the whole over the shower head caddy is suitable for the vast majority of bathrooms, and can make your toiletries within reach. At the same time, the central heightened design can place more high shower gel, etc. Special note: The width of the U-shaped iron piece is only 3.54inch, so any showerheads larger than 9cm in width need to be unscrewed and set on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61guEr1L21L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AHNR","source_asin":"B0C6GTXDVW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-256382","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6GTXDVW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6GTXDVW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
