window.products.push({"id":256406,"name":"22\" Gray and Ivory Diamond Puffs Decorative Throw","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lyzW98PkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From the Ogee Collection Square pillow features a contemporary chevron design with warm earth tones Color(s): birch and Moon Mist Sewn seam closure Care instructions: spot clean or dry clean only Dimensions: 22\"H x 22\"W Material(s): Shell: cotton Filling: down A portion of the profits from these rugs and pillows goes towards a school lunch program that serves fresh, nutritious daily meals to 1.3 million children in rural India. For many children, this is their only substantial meal of the day. Additional donations are also made to a scholarship program that enhances literacy and learning in Southeast Asia. Nearly 80 percent of children from impoverished families drop out before graduation due to the burden of educational fees, books and uniforms. This program helps compensate for all school expenses in addition to mandating and paying for after-school tutoring for students most in need.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lyzW98PkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Diva At Home","source_asin":"B00OQP53IE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-256406","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OQP53IE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OQP53IE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":256407,"name":"Sleepwish Black Neon Dragonfly Bedding Purple Pink Dragonfly Green Mandala Pattern Bed Set 3 Piece Teens Kids Insect Print Duvet Cover (Queen)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IEye01pmL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"IMPORTANT NOTE: NO STUFFING INSIDE the duvet cover(not include any comforter or filling) you can put your own comforter, duvet or blanket into the cover, just COVER. Twin size: 1 Duvet Cover (68\" x86\") and 2 Pillowcase (20\" x 26\"). No Comforter in Set.Full size: 1 Duvet Cover (80\" x 90\") and 2 Pillowcases (20\" x 26\"). No Comforter in Set.Queen size: 1 Duvet Cover (90\" x 90\") and 2 Pillowcases (20\" x 36\"). No Comforter in Set.king size: 1 Duvet Cover (104\" x 90\") and 2 Pillowcases (20\" x 36\"). No Comforter in Set.DUVET COVER: A duvet cover is a protective layer that slips over the duvet and has a closure. Because duvets and comforters can be expensive and difficult to clean, duvet covers are useful because they protect your comforter during use and are easily removed and easy to wash.You can also quickly and easily change the look of your bed and room without having to completely redecorate.The duvet cover also allows you to change your style or color of your bedding with the simple switch of the cover.HOW TO USE THE DUVET COVER: 1) Lay the comforter flat. 2) Insert your hands inside and find the two top corners. holding one corner in each hand. 3) With your hands inside the duvet cover, reach down to grab hold of the comforter’s top two corners. 4) Holding the top two corners tightly, give it a shake and a fluff until the duvet cover falls down to cover most of the comforter. 5) Stuff the bottom two corners of the comforter inside the bottom two corners of the duvet cover. zip it up at last!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IEye01pmL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sleepwish","source_asin":"B07HN1KFX4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-256407","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HN1KFX4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HN1KFX4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
