window.products.push({"id":256564,"name":"Bedsure Twin Extra Long Comforter Set - Bed Set Reversible Percale Stripes Down Alternative Sea Foam Green Twin/Twin XL Comforter Sets Box Stitching w","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tGr95a9qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bedsure all season comforter mimics the texture of down with its soft polyester fabric. Cloud-like softness that comforts you all night and all year around Reversible design with our percale yarn-dyed fabric on one side and brushed polyester on the other turns out to be perfect for all skins The unique box sewn-through stitching and double sewing thread greatly ensure durability, considered appropriate for long-term use Easy-care comforter can be machine washed. Pillow shams with horizontal stripes and comforter with vertical stripes add a simple yet classy vibe to your bedroom Green comforter with stripes design add cozy yet contemporary touch to your space. Twin size bedding set includes 1 comforter (68×88\") and 1 pillow shams (20X26\")","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tGr95a9qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BEDSURE","source_asin":"B093737D3B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-256564","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093737D3B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093737D3B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":256565,"name":"ARIGHTEX Mermaid Bedding for Girls Colorful Underwater Life Duvet Cover 3 Piece Cute Whimsy Mermaid Bed Set (Full)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.58,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81acmE1+JsL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"To help your comforter stay cleaner and last longer, invest in a decorative bedding duvet cover. Duvets covers are machine washable and are made with easy-to-close hidden zippers, making it easy to take on and off. PRODUCT SPECIFICATION: - Fabric: 100% lightweight microfiber,material; - Images imprinted using heat dyesublimation technique for lasting effects; - Size: 4 sizes; - CARE: no extra care, machine washable andtumble dryer safe.  AVAILABLE SIZES: Twin: 1*Duvet cover: 69 by 86 inches 2*Pillow Shams: 20 by 26 inches Full: 1*Duvet cover: 81 by 90 inches 2*Pillow Shams: 20 by 26 inches Queen: 1*Duvet cover: 90 by 90 inches 2*Pillow Shams: 20 by 36 inches King: 1*Duvet cover: 104 by 90 inches 2*Pillow Shams: 20 by 36 inches FINISH: Step 1: Lay the comforter flat on top of your mattress. Step 2: Take your duvet cover and turn it inside out. Insert your hands inside and find the two top corners. You should now be holding one corner in each hand. Step 3: With your hands inside the duvet cover, reach down to grab hold of the comforter’s top two corners Step 4: Holding the top two corner slightly, flip the duvet cover right side out over the comforter. Give it a shake and a fluff until the duvet cover falls down to cover most of the comforter. Step 5: Pull the duvet cover down. Stuff the bottom two corners of the comforter inside the bottom two corners of the duvet cover. Once everything is aligned, zip it up!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81acmE1+JsL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARIGHTEX","source_asin":"B07R5HB2JN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-256565","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R5HB2JN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R5HB2JN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
