window.products.push({"id":256588,"name":"Outus 2 Pieces 3D Frameless Wall Clock Stickers Decoration DIY Wall Clock Sticker for Living Room Bedroom (Black and Silver)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714l0LobE7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2 Pieces 3D frameless wall clock stickers decoration DIY wall clock sticker for living room bedroom, black and silver  Stylish and modern decoration wall clock: The DIY wall clock lifts every room and give it a nice feature. The frameless clock design will not make your apartment look cluttered. The clock wall decor looks good on white walls, but also colored walls for making a good fit with the open and clean design.  Good-working and precise wall clock: Don't forget about the time with the stylish decorative wall clock. Please note that tuning the time by hand might impair the clock mechanism, please use controls on the back of the centerpiece.  Suite for many styles and every room: Combine the large wall clock with different furniture styles, it will always look great and fit. It is a great accessory for every apartment. Use it as a living room wall clock, bedroom wall clock, office wall clock or in the kitchen.  Specifications: Clock (normal configuration as shown in the pictures): 15.75 x 15.75 inch Hour hand: 85 mm/ 3.35 inches in length Minute hand: 130 mm/ 5.12 inches in length second hand: 135 mm/ 5.31 inches in length Centerpiece: 3.5 inch in diameter Color: black, silver  Package includes: 2 x 3D frameless wall clock stickers  Note: 1. AA carbon batteries required for operation (not included). 2. When placing the minute hand and the hour hand into the centerpiece, align them towards 12 o'clock. 3. Don't tune the time using your hands, it might impair the clock mechanism. There are control buttons on the back of the centerpiece, please use them. 4. The mirror wall clock numbers and hands have a protective film, please tear it off after installation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714l0LobE7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Outus","source_asin":"B08F5HP1T9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-256588","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F5HP1T9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F5HP1T9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
