window.products.push({"id":256628,"name":"DfactoryM Danish Dough Whisk for Bread Making - 3 Pcs Utensil Set for Sourdough Mixing Cutting Artisan Decorating-Manual Blender with Polished Handle ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iTyT97SMS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For all enthusiasts who have grown to love the art of rustic home bread-making, having the right utensils will almost certainly elevate your final products' quality and make working with any dough a little easier and less intimidating. This set will make mixing, cutting, and modeling any kind of dough batters one step easier. Ideal for all kinds of cooking tasks, from mixing muffin batter to tossing together an apple pie filling, our lightweight manual mixer can stir, blend and fold large quantities of ingredients as we speak, without overworking the dough. Featuring a unique flow-through design, it gently blends souffle, muffin, or pancake dough. Four stainless steel hoops blend ingredients thoroughly, gently, and effortlessly, while a smooth rubberwood handle, satin polished for comfortable maneuvering, provides an easier stirring process compared to that of a wooden spoon. What's best is that your arm won't get as tired! The upgraded design with no gap between the wire head and the handle, and top quality materials, won't let liquids or flour get trapped inside while allowing super easy cleaning. This dough mixer will be around to serve you for a long time, much longer than others. Curved edges, with the specific purpose of cutting and handling a dough, the scraper included in our set does more than you may think. It's perfect for reaching into the corners of the bowls, helping to minimize dough waste and save ingredients, and can easily collect chopped vegetables from a chopping board. Take the stress out of scoring your artisan homemade bread with the bread lame included as well in our set, meant to help you achieve a clean direct cut or many popular decorative cuts, into any sourdough. The Danish dough whisk set makes a unique gift for someone who likes to bake, professional or novice! Throw it together with your favorite baking cookbook and you have an excellent gift. Also ideal for wedding gifts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iTyT97SMS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DfactoryM","source_asin":"B08TYZX19G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-256628","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TYZX19G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TYZX19G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
