window.products.push({"id":256650,"name":"Weighted Blanket 25lb for Adult, 80''x87'' Queen Size Weighted Blanket with Double-Sided Design, Warm Short Plush and Cool Tencel Fabric Reversible We","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":124.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71auw71NYTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ COOL & WARM 2 in 1 INNOVATIVE DESIGN: Designed as double sides for reversible use. One side of the blanket is Tencel fabric(300TC) which is made of 100% natural eucalyptus fiber and provides a silky touch and coolness, making it the perfect choice for hot and perspire sleepers. The other side uses 330GSM SHORT PLUSH material, softer and warmer than the regular cotton blanket, helps you stay warm during winter nights. Now you can use our warm and cooling weighted blankets in all seasons ✅ SMALLER POCKETS, NO LEAKS, NO NOISE: High-density stitch (0.25 mm needle gauge) and double-thread sewing prevent the blanket from leaking glass beads. The small pocket is divided into 4x smaller pockets by double stitching, making the glass beads more evenly distributed and no noise when moving the body, giving you a restful, comfortable sleep ✅ WEIGHT & SIZE:First, select the right size for your bed. Some sellers have listed the 80\" x 87\" as a king size blanket, it's not accurate. As shown in the image, the blanket hangs down on a queen bed, but on a king bed, the blanket is on top of the mattress. Next, choose the blanket’s weight. 7-12% of body weight will be the most comfortable. The pressure of the blanket makes you feel like you're being hugged or swaddled.This 80''x87''-25lb blanket provides MEDIUM PRESSURE ✅ 7-LAYER DESIGN & LUXURIOUS PACKING: Superior to original weighted blanket, this Weighted Blanket includes two extra breathable cotton layers between the outmost premium fabric and non-glue polyester padding, for most adaption to your body shape and better temperature control. The weighted blanket comes with luxurious packing bag for easy carry & storage or traveling, and can also be sent as a thoughtful gift ✅ ABOVE INDUSTRY STANDARD & RISK-FREE PURCHASE: Our premium Weighted Blanket makes it easy for you to fall asleep naturally, and wake up feeling rested and ready to conquer your day! Buy with confidence! Your satisfaction is backed by our Risk-free 30 Day and 2-Year of Friendly Customer Service. PRESS THE BUTTON «ADD TO CART» Right Now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71auw71NYTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OMYSTYLE","source_asin":"B07S7XV46N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-256650","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S7XV46N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S7XV46N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
