window.products.push({"id":256743,"name":"Electrolux UniRapido Stick Vacuum, EL852A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lVxHvT1zL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description Everything about this stick vacuum makes it extremely easy to use. The big push button allows the dust container to pop out easily, so emptying the dust cup remains a clean process. There are two washable filters inside, which are also easy, to remove and clean from time to time. Amazon.com Looking for one quick clean? The Electrolux Unirapido lightweight stick vacuum EL852A is an ideal choice for quick cleaning of your bare floors as well as area rugs. for quick pickups around your home. This cordless stick vacuum will go wherever you go as it is easy to maneuver and its lightweight allows you to carry it anywhere. Here is a trendy vacuum that you won’t feel compelled to store in the cupboard. The Electrolux Unirapido is an easy to recharge cordless stick vacuum cleaner that comes in handy if you want to do a quick clean up around the kitchen floor to get rid of crumbs. There are two suction speed settings – higher suction is better suited for carpets and area rugs. A more quiet machine when operating in the lower setting, the Unirapido is still fully capable of lifting fluff and bits that you can see from the carpet. One Quick Clean Everything about this stick vacuum makes it extremely easy to use. The big push button allows the dust container to pop out easily, so emptying the dust cup remains a clean process. There are two washable filters inside, which are also easy, to remove and clean from time to time.  Other key features of the Unirapido include its maneuverability and lightweight. Weighing only 4.5 pounds, it is easy to push around the house. The head pivots and twists smoothly without having to twist your wrist and negotiates corners with ease. If you alter your grip it’s light to pick up and carry, too. The Unirapido includes 12 volts of power, a run time of 20 minutes under normal speed, washable filter, an extra-large dust cup that can hold upto 1 liter of dust, and bagless cyclonic cleaning technology which eliminates the need to purchase replacement bags. Getting the Best Results • Charge for 24 hours before first use. Leave Unirapido on charge when not in use. Warm adaptor is normal. Start the Unirapido and use in normal speed for longer usage and in high speed to get maximum cleaning power. • Avoid scratching hard wood floors by checking that nozzle, wheels and brush roll are clean. UniRapido’s dust container must be emptied regularly, plus dust container and filters need to be cleaned to maintain a high suction power. Clean the filters every third emptying or when UniRapido has low suction power. Make sure parts are dry before reassembling. • If the brush roll becomes blocked or jammed, a protection circuit will block the power supply to the motor. Then clean the brush.  Idea for bare floors and area rug cleaning Product Features Good Grip Handle Allows you to maneuver the vacuum easily and reaches hard to reach areas without having to twist your wrist. Includes a 2 speed on/off button Flexible Pivot Point The secret to the highly maneuverable nozzle. Equipped with a motorized nozzle for more effective dirt and dust pick up Extra Large Dust Cup The cyclonic action keeps dirt away from filter to improve performance and can hold upto 1 liter of dust Electrolux Unirapido Specifications Model: EL 852A Battery Type Power: NiMH, 12V Suction System: Cyclonic Filtration: Washable Filter Tools: NA Surface Cleaning Type: Bare floors, Area rugs Product Weight: 4.5 lbs. Dust Capacity: 1 Dry liter Suction Control: High/Low Selector Run Time: 20 mins under normal speed Container: Bagless","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lVxHvT1zL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Electrolux","source_asin":"B0044T65UC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-256743","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0044T65UC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0044T65UC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
