window.products.push({"id":256847,"name":"Elechomes Air Purifier KJ203F-142 Replacement Filter, 4-in-1 True HEPA, High-Efficiency Activated Carbon and Cold Catalyst Filter, 142-RF, 1 Pack, Gre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bLA1f7G1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When Should I Replace My Filter? When the cumulative use time reaches 3000 hours, Sleep Mode Button and Timer Button will flash simultaneously, which means that you have to replace the filter.  But this does not mean that you have to wait until 3,000 hours before replacing the filter. It depends on the air quality in your room.  You may need to replace your filter if you notice: ● Sleep Mode Button and Timer Button flash simultaneously ● Increased noise when the air purifier is on ● Decreased airflow ● Unusual odors ● A visibly clogged filter Replacing the Filter ● Unplug the air purifier. Open the rear cover of the purifier from the two handle positions of the purifier. ● Remove the old filter. ● Remove the packaging bag of the new filter.  ● Place the new filter into the housing. Make sure that the two pull strips on the filter face the outside. ● Replace the rear cover. Plug in the air purifier. ● Press and at the same time and hold for 3 seconds to reset the filter. If you need additional help, feel free to reach out to Elechomes helpful support.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bLA1f7G1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elechomes","source_asin":"B08VRTCM2K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-256847","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VRTCM2K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VRTCM2K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
