window.products.push({"id":256888,"name":"DeerBird® Both Side Differ Color Moving Grit Picture Abstract Scenery 3D Vision Moving Grit Picture Flow Sand Painting","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sGxTZwv3L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Adopt double color frame,fresh and natural which bring you different artistic experience,and you can change white frame or blue frame anytime. Dynamic scene technology, can form a levels clearly demarcated screen, you can make the sea roaring, mountain tilt, desert blown sand. In the enjoyment of the time to play can often harvest the unexpected aesthetic effect. Simple operation:When operating,Only need to take this product shake a moment left and right ,making all sands concentrated in the bottom,While the fixed proportion of the air inside will be scattered into small bubbles,then it can be reversed.Wait a moment,valleys and dunes would shown up before your eyes!It deserve your waiting. It can be hung on the wall or placed on the desktop free to flip, Function: gifts to share, home furnishings, children's play, intellectual development, classic nostalgia. Specifications: Product Size: 18.5x14.5x3.3 CM  Packing size: 18.8x14.2x3.5 CM  Frame Color: Blue and White  Frame Material: ABS Plastic  Weight: 400g  Style: Abstract landscapes Packing details: 1 x Flowed sand Picture Note: When winter the produst is put on the outside, the temperature is below zero, it will be frozen, but the frozen flowed sand, such as the snow-capped mountains covered with layers of pine, is very beautiful, do not worry too much.When the temperature is higher than zero, melt sand can continue to flow . Taking into account the cold weather in winter, in order to avoid accidents, it is not recommended to put the quicksand outdoors. Bubble stuck is also a normal phenomenon because bubble buoyancy and sand gravity balance, which the probability of the situation is very small.Only the flow sand painting injected into the gas can the sand be flowed, preferably in about 2mm, there are individual gas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sGxTZwv3L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DeerBird","source_asin":"B073B2D7LK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-256888","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073B2D7LK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073B2D7LK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
