window.products.push({"id":256898,"name":"Zyliss 9-inch Nonstick Springform Cake Pan - Springform Pan and Cake Mold - Carbon Steel Pan - Roasting and Grilling Cookware - Baking and Cooking Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hy-BkoR2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Flexibility in the kitchen can be invaluable! The Zyliss 9-inch Non-Stick Springform Cake Pan offers versatility when it comes to prepping some of your favorite entrees and desserts. This nonstick cake pan includes raised edges that make it a natural selection for cheesecakes and other round cakes. The baking pan's incredibly smooth sides will leave no indentations on your cake, helping you to get that pro finish at home. It’s a design that also makes it an ideal roasting and grilling pan for potatoes and vegetables. Featuring two layers of a durable, nonstick Quantum II coating, this baking and cooking tray will prevent foods from sticking while ensuring an easy and mess-free release every single time. Designed to withstand 475° F, the Zyliss Nonstick Springform Cake Pan features a carbon steel construction that’s built to last. The addition of rolled edges on this non-stick baking pan provides some added strength and resistance to warping, ensuring it as a durable choice. This nonstick roasting and cooking pan is dishwasher safe, providing an easy and near effortless solution to cleaning. You’ll have plenty of options readily available to you whenever you reach for this 9-inch non-stick cake pan from Zyliss! Product Details: Care Instructions: Dishwasher Safe Materials: Carbon Steel Warranty: 5-Year Guarantee Dimensions: 9.41\"\" x 9.41\"\" x 3.15\"\" Weight: 1.30 lb. Since 1951, Zyliss has been creating kitchen tools and gadgets to meet the growing need of consumers worldwide. Behind every Zyliss kitchen tool is the \"\"design to delight\"\" principle. The belief is that all Zyliss products should work simply and efficiently while making customers smile every time you use the them. With over 70 years of experience in designing quality food preparation tools and gadgets, it is easy to see how Zyliss has become an internationally respected brand favored by both everyday cooks and gourmet chefs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hy-BkoR2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zyliss","source_asin":"B09P4S1TGN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-256898","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P4S1TGN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P4S1TGN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
