window.products.push({"id":256990,"name":"Halloween Blood Bags Drink Container & Pouches,Reusable Live Blood Cups of Theme Parties,10 Pack,Set of Labels,Funnel and Clips,400ML, Nursing School ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Lmvd60vmL._AC_.jpg","description":"This blood bag drink Container is a safe,realistic and very easy to fill drink Container properly ---Make your Halloween party or other theme party are unique and fun. ❤【Theme Party Decorations Food Container】 Blood bags can fill with soda, jello, juice, alcohol and any homemade fruit drink can be filled in,which also is perfect as Halloween party cups, decorations, cosplay, ice bag or even vampire TV or movie props.The blood bag is beloved by vampires around the world! ❤【Safety Of Blood Bags】 Blood bag is made of food-grade PVC materials ,But the blood bags have better toughness.Safe and clean,The blood bags are produced in dust-free workshops, absolutely sterile and non-toxic.both adults and children can use blood bag happily. ❤【The Blood Blood How It Works 】 ☺Step 1: Take out the blood bags and insert the funnel into the straw of the blood package. ☺Step 2: Funnel the prepared drinks into blood bags. ☺Step 3: Use the clip to lock the straw of the blood bag ,avoid spillage. ☺Step 4: Attach the label to the blood bag and check the blood type. ❤【Convenience Set】Package includes: 10 X Blood Bags & 10 X Clips 10 X labels: blood type A, B, AB, O can be pasted on the blood bag and checked at will. 1 X Funnel: It makes blood bag easier and faster to be filled,Only 10 seconds! ❤【More blood bag Specifications】 Blood Bag Size: 7.1 In *4.1 In Capacity of Blood Bag: Max 400 ML Blood Bag Tube Length: 5.3 In ★NOTE:Do not fill blood bag with hot drinks. Overheating and freezing may damage the blood bag and cause leakage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Lmvd60vmL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KEEPOOM","source_asin":"B07H2V296M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-256990","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H2V296M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H2V296M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
